{"title": "Three signals, thirty seconds", "type": "Speed cheat sheet", "hooks": ["Three chart signals in thirty seconds. The first one fooled its buyers.", "Learn three chart signals in thirty seconds.", "Three chart signals, thirty seconds, three real charts."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Three chart signals in thirty seconds. The first one fooled its buyers.", "text": "3 signals. 30 seconds.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "1. Bullish engulfing", "show": 90, "vo": "One: bullish engulfing. A green body covers the whole red body before it. Here, ten candles later, the price was 7.1 percent lower.", "cues": [{"say": "bullish engulfing", "do": "mark", "i": 90, "label": "1", "side": "high", "tone": "green"}, {"say": "ten candles later", "do": "reveal", "to": 100}], "win": [20, 102]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 1, "head": "2. Downtrend", "show": 90, "vo": "Two: a downtrend. Lower highs and lower lows. The next twenty-five candles fell 9.7 percent.", "cues": [{"say": "Lower highs", "do": "mark", "i": 86, "label": "LH", "side": "high", "tone": "red"}, {"say": "lower lows", "do": "mark", "i": 85, "label": "LL", "side": "low", "tone": "red"}, {"say": "next twenty-five candles", "do": "reveal", "to": 115}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 2, "head": "3. Bear flag", "show": 90, "vo": "Three: a bear flag. A sharp drop, then a drift. It only counts once a close breaks the flag's edge. This one broke upward first.", "cues": [{"say": "A sharp drop", "do": "shade", "from": 80, "to": 86, "tone": "red"}, {"say": "broke upward first", "do": "reveal", "to": 95}], "win": [20, 115]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "A clue, never a promise", "vo": "One candle or pattern is a clue, never a promise. It matters most at a level, with volume behind it.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Save this cheat sheet", "vo": "Save this, and practise spotting all three at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "Three chart signals in thirty secon